hey what is up everybody it's animak  here for  anime uproar and i often get questions  about the exact sizes of the titans from  the attack on titan story  and how they compare to each other which  titans are the tallest  which are the shortest and so on so  because this is such a hot topic of  discussion  in our community i decided to do a quick  video where i rank  all of the notable titans based on  height from shortest to  tallest if you enjoy our attack on titan  videos and you want to see  more please leave a like and comment it  only takes a second  but it helps a lot and if you're new to  the channel or maybe you just watch our  videos but you haven't subscribed yet  make this the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on  all notifications the only way to make  sure you won't miss our videos in the  future  is to click subscribe hit that bell and  then select the option that says  all i know it's annoying it's an extra  step but that's how youtube works  by the way don't forget to check out our  large and growing  attack on titan video playlist i will  link the playlist in the description  and in the pinned comment so definitely  check it out if you're looking for more  attack on titan content  finally this video will contain attack  on titan manga spoilers we are talking  about all the titans in the story so  please  proceed with caution you have been  warned  okay now just a quick note when it comes  to the pure titans also known as the  mindless titans i will speak  in general terms i won't be trying to  determine the exact  height of every single titan npc  also for some of the titans i will be  discussing their exact height is  simply unknown so the best that we can  do  is make an educated guess based on the  information  and images that are available with that  said let's start off  with the mindless or pure titans these  guys can vary greatly when it comes to  height  and their general range is between 2  meters and 15 meters in height  even though 2 meters is widely believed  to be the smallest  titan size and that is the smallest size  listed on the official attack on titan  wiki  the actual small titans we've seen tend  to be closer to 3 meters  and i mean that makes sense since there  are plenty of normal humans out  there who are 2 meters in height or  taller so having a titan who is about as  tall as a tall  human kind of defeats the purpose of the  name titan  some notable mindless titans that we've  seen within that  2 to 15 meter range include the titan  coney's dad turned into who was about  3 meters tall sunny who was about 4  meters tall  bean who was about 7 meters tall and  dina fritz's smiling titan  who was between 14 and 15 meters tall  mindless titans comprise the vast  majority of all the titans that we've  seen in the story  and their behavior is quite predictable  they are known for simply going after  the first human they see  in an attempt to devour them however  abnormal titans  are far more unpredictable they might  ignore the humans who are closest to  them and  choose to instead go after other  individuals or groups of individuals who  are much further away  they might even exhibit some very  strange behavior for a titan such as  running quickly  jumping or even talking okay now let's  talk about the kart titan  the only titan shifter who walks  exclusively on  all fours due to the fact that it  doesn't walk on two legs  the car titan stands at only about four  meters in height  and that puts it on the lower end of  even the mindless titan height range  just a bit taller than the cart titan is  the jaw titan  who tends to be roughly 5 meters in  height regardless of its user  this is likely because the jaw titan's  signature abilities include speed  and agility and this requires a smaller  lighter body  then we have the founding titan form of  frieda reese  frieda's founding titan is about 13  meters in height  so now we're getting into the bigger  titans the attack on titan wiki  also lists carl fritz's founding titan  at about 13 meters  although i am not so sure about that we  only get like one still image of that  titan in the entire story  but based on that image alone he appears  to be taller than 13 meters  at least in my opinion it might just be  the angle of the image  but compared to the humans below it to  me carl fritz's titan's height  looks closer to the height of the  colossal titan than the height of  frida's founding titan  let me know down in the comments what  you guys think about carl fritz's  founding titan and how tall  it was does 13 meters sound right to you  or do you think that he was taller  alright now let's move on to the female  titan  annie is the only known female titan  shifter in the story  and her titan is about 14 meters in  height  just a bit taller than the female titan  we have the attack titan  who is around 50 meters in height  regardless of the user  reiner's armor titan is also about 15  meters in height  as is lara tiber's warhammer titan  after that we have zeke's beast titan  who stands at an impressive 17 meters  in height from what we've seen so far  the beast titan forms  very greatly depending on their user so  we can assume that the height  of the beast titan will also be  drastically different  depending on the user then we have the  wall titans  the thousands of abnormal titans who  were sealed away  inside the three walls on paradise  island  they all closely resemble the colossal  titan shifter  but they are believed to be about 10  meters shorter  the colossal titan shifter is 60 meters  in height  and the walls are 50 meters tall so the  assumption is that the wall titans are  about 50 meters as well  however there are people who believe  that the legs of the wall titans were  partially buried in the ground  when they were sealed away inside the  walls and so their true height  after they break free from the wall  could be around 60 meters  just like the colossal titan shifter  following the colossal titans  imposing 60 meter height the next titan  that we need to talk about  is rodris's abnormal titan who was a  staggering  120 meters in height twice the size of  the colossal  titan even though this was an abnormal  mindless titan  and not a titan shifter for a very long  time  this was by far the biggest titan that  we had ever seen  due to this titan's massive size and  disproportional bodily dimensions  it was unable to stand upright without  support and most of the time  it had to crawl on the ground the only  time that it was able to stand was while  using the wall  for support now let's talk about emir  fritz's  original founding titan the very first  titan  and the only one to hold all nine titan  shifter powers  within one person it is difficult to  determine this titan's exact size  because all we have are a couple of  manga panels as reference points  this titan appears to have been  considerably bigger than even the  colossal titan  but how much bigger is the real question  i've seen various estimates about emir's  titan's height  that range from like 100 meters to all  the way up to 240 meters  some have argued that emir fritz's titan  had to have been smaller than rod  reese's titan  because rod reese's titan couldn't even  walk upright without support  so theoretically if emir's titan was  even bigger  then how could it have walked well first  of all emir's titan had very different  proportions  and a totally different bodily structure  than the rod reese titan  so in that sense it's not an exact  comparison  and also in the manga we never actually  see emir's titan form  standing completely upright so it is  possible that she spent  most of her time crawling on the ground  rather than walking  upright my personal guess is that emir's  titan was indeed  bigger than rods and that she was about  200 meters in height  when standing completely upright and  finally we have the biggest titan in the  history of attack on titan  aaron's absolutely gigantic founding  titan  form this skeletal spider-esque titan  is something straight out of a horror  film and as with emir's titan  we don't have an exact measurement for  him all we have to go by  are a number of manga panels the  estimates i've seen for this titan's  height  also vary wildly i've seen estimates as  low as 350 meters and as high as  900 meters i even tried to do my own  calculations by measuring the wall  titans in a panel right next to aaron's  new titan form  and then using their size of roughly 50  meters as a point of comparison  by my calculations aaron's founding  titan  is at least 500 meters in height and  that is a conservative estimate  but regardless of what his exact height  is  aaron's gigantic founding titan form is  by far the biggest titan  in the attack on titan story and  that is it all the notable titans ranked  from  shortest to tallest i know that a lot of  this was speculation and educated  guessing so feel free to let me know  if you disagree with any of the  estimates in this video  and of course don't hesitate to give me  your own personal estimates and  guesstimates  down in the comments below if you  enjoyed this video and you want to see  more attack on titan content right here  on the channel  please leave a like and comment it only  takes a second but it helps a lot  and if you're new to anime outpour or  maybe you've been watching our videos  but you didn't subscribe yet  make this the video that you subscribe  and hit that notification bell  to turn on all notifications  don't forget to check out our large and  growing attack on titan video playlist  i will link it down in the description  and in the pinned  comment you can also hit me up on  twitter  and instagram at animeopror  a big thank you to all of our anime  outpour patrons for making videos like  this one possible  special thank you to alpha sigma  disciple of lord twigo himself  and i can't forget all of our the one  tie